      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see what this is doing, that the Protocols considered for the export is the union of all Protocols specified for the EXPORT or any CLIENT blocks (factoring in EXPORT_DEFAULTS also).\n\n\nBut I\u0027m not sure of this, the expectation in the past was always that:\n\nNFS_CORE_PARAM Protocols was (at least) the union of all Protocols used in EXPORTs\n\nEXPORT Protocols was (at least) the union of all Protocols used in CLIENTs\n\nIs there a reason your use case can\u0027t just set the Protocols for the EXPORT to (at least) the union\u003e",
